{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "6f4c2a1e-8b3d-4e5f-9a7b-1c2d3e4f5a6b",
    "name": "Blogify API",
    "description": "API REST de la plateforme de blog headless Blogify.\n\n## Utilisation\n\n1. Dans les variables de la collection, renseigner `email`, `password` et `name`. `baseUrl` pointe sur le stage `dev`.\n2. Lancer **Inscription**, puis copier le code reçu par e-mail dans la variable `code` et lancer **Confirmation**.\n3. Lancer **Connexion** : les scripts enregistrent `idToken` et `refreshToken` dans les variables.\n4. Les routes protégées envoient automatiquement `Authorization: {{idToken}}` (authentification définie au niveau de la collection).\n5. **Créer un article** enregistre `postId`, utilisé par les autres requêtes sur les articles.\n6. **Demander une URL d'envoi** enregistre `mediaOwnerId`, `mediaId` et le formulaire S3 ; **Envoyer le fichier sur S3** l'utilise (choisir le fichier dans le champ `file`).\n\nLe rôle est lu dans le token : après un changement de rôle, relancer **Connexion** ou **Rafraîchir le token**.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "apikey",
    "apikey": [
      { "key": "key", "value": "Authorization", "type": "string" },
      { "key": "value", "value": "{{idToken}}", "type": "string" },
      { "key": "in", "value": "header", "type": "string" }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "https://fzyokm8jq6.execute-api.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/dev", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "email", "value": "prenom.nom@exemple.com", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "password", "value": "Motdepasse1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "name", "value": "Prénom Nom", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "code", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "idToken", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "refreshToken", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "userId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "targetUserId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "targetRole", "value": "editor", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "postId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "mediaId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "mediaOwnerId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "uploadUrl", "value": "", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "description": "Inscription, confirmation, connexion et profil. Toutes les routes sont publiques sauf **Mon profil**.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Inscription",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('201 Created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('rôle guest-author par défaut', () => pm.expect(body.role).to.eql('guest-author'));",
                  "",
                  "if (body.userId) pm.collectionVariables.set('userId', body.userId);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\",\n  \"name\": \"{{name}}\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "register"]
            },
            "description": "Crée un compte avec le rôle `guest-author` et envoie un code de vérification par e-mail.\n\nMot de passe : 8 caractères minimum, avec une majuscule, une minuscule et un chiffre.\n\nErreurs : `400 VALIDATION_ERROR`, `400 INVALID_PASSWORD`, `409 USER_ALREADY_EXISTS`."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Confirmation",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"code\": \"{{code}}\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/confirm",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "confirm"]
            },
            "description": "Valide le compte avec le code reçu par e-mail (à copier dans la variable `code`).\n\nErreurs : `400 INVALID_CODE`, `400 EXPIRED_CODE`."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Connexion",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('tokens présents', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(body.idToken).to.be.a('string');",
                  "  pm.expect(body.refreshToken).to.be.a('string');",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "if (body.idToken) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('idToken', body.idToken);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', body.refreshToken);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Retourne un `idToken` (valable 1 h, à envoyer dans le header `Authorization`) et un `refreshToken` (valable 30 jours).\n\nErreurs : `401 NOT_AUTHORIZED` (identifiants incorrects), `403 USER_NOT_CONFIRMED`."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Rafraîchir le token",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (body.idToken) pm.collectionVariables.set('idToken', body.idToken);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refreshToken}}\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "refresh"]
            },
            "description": "Échange le `refreshToken` contre un nouvel `idToken`, qui reflète le rôle actuel de l'utilisateur.\n\nErreurs : `401 NOT_AUTHORIZED`."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Mon profil",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('rôle valide', () => pm.expect(body.role).to.be.oneOf(['admin', 'editor', 'guest-author']));",
                  "",
                  "if (body.userId) pm.collectionVariables.set('userId', body.userId);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/me",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "me"]
            },
            "description": "Retourne l'identifiant, l'e-mail, le nom et le rôle de l'utilisateur connecté, lus dans le token.\n\nErreurs : `401 UNAUTHORIZED` (token absent, invalide ou expiré)."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Utilisateurs (admin)",
      "description": "Gestion des utilisateurs, réservée au rôle `admin`. Le premier admin se crée depuis la console Cognito.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Lister les utilisateurs",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('liste dans items', () => pm.expect(body.items).to.be.an('array'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["users"]
            },
            "description": "Liste les utilisateurs avec leur rôle, leur statut et leur date de création. Copier le `userId` d'un utilisateur dans la variable `targetUserId` pour changer son rôle.\n\nErreurs : `401 UNAUTHORIZED`, `403 FORBIDDEN` (rôle autre qu'admin)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Changer le rôle",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('nouveau rôle appliqué', () => pm.expect(body.role).to.eql(pm.collectionVariables.get('targetRole')));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"role\": \"{{targetRole}}\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users/{{targetUserId}}/role",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["users", "{{targetUserId}}", "role"]
            },
            "description": "Attribue le rôle `admin`, `editor` ou `guest-author` à l'utilisateur `targetUserId`. Le changement s'applique aux tokens émis ensuite (prochaine connexion ou rafraîchissement).\n\nErreurs : `400 VALIDATION_ERROR`, `400 CANNOT_CHANGE_OWN_ROLE`, `403 FORBIDDEN`, `404 USER_NOT_FOUND`."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Articles (public)",
      "description": "Lecture des articles publiés, sans authentification. Les brouillons ne sont jamais visibles ici.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Lister les articles publiés",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('liste dans items', () => pm.expect(body.items).to.be.an('array'));",
                  "pm.test('pas de content dans la liste', () => body.items.forEach((post) => pm.expect(post).to.not.have.property('content')));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/posts?limit=20",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["posts"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "limit", "value": "20" },
                { "key": "nextToken", "value": "", "disabled": true }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Articles publiés, du plus récent au plus ancien, sans le champ `content`. `limit` : 1 à 100 (20 par défaut). Si la réponse contient `nextToken`, le passer en paramètre pour obtenir la page suivante.\n\nErreurs : `400 VALIDATION_ERROR`, `400 INVALID_NEXT_TOKEN`."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Lire un article publié",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('article publié avec son contenu', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(body.status).to.eql('published');",
                  "  pm.expect(body.content).to.be.a('string');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/posts/{{postId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["posts", "{{postId}}"]
            },
            "description": "Article complet, uniquement s'il est publié.\n\nErreurs : `404 POST_NOT_FOUND` (inexistant ou brouillon)."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Articles (gestion)",
      "description": "Gestion des articles, authentifiée. Un `guest-author` gère ses propres articles, sans pouvoir publier ; un `editor` ou un `admin` gère tous les articles.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Créer un article",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('201 Created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('créé en brouillon', () => pm.expect(body.status).to.eql('draft'));",
                  "",
                  "if (body.postId) pm.collectionVariables.set('postId', body.postId);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"Mon premier article\",\n  \"content\": \"# Bonjour\\n\\nContenu en **Markdown**.\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/manage/posts",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["manage", "posts"]
            },
            "description": "Crée un brouillon dont l'auteur est l'utilisateur connecté. `title` : 1 à 200 caractères ; `content` : 100 000 caractères maximum.\n\nErreurs : `400 VALIDATION_ERROR`, `401 UNAUTHORIZED`."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Lister les articles",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('liste dans items', () => pm.expect(body.items).to.be.an('array'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/manage/posts?limit=20",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["manage", "posts"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "limit", "value": "20" },
                { "key": "status", "value": "draft", "disabled": true },
                { "key": "nextToken", "value": "", "disabled": true }
              ]
            },
            "description": "`guest-author` : ses propres articles, tous statuts (filtrable avec `status`). `editor` / `admin` : tous les articles du statut demandé, `draft` par défaut (la file de relecture). Pagination comme la liste publique.\n\nErreurs : `400 VALIDATION_ERROR`, `400 INVALID_NEXT_TOKEN`, `401 UNAUTHORIZED`."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Lire un article",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/manage/posts/{{postId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["manage", "posts", "{{postId}}"]
            },
            "description": "Article complet, quel que soit son statut.\n\nErreurs : `403 FORBIDDEN` (article d'un autre auteur pour un `guest-author`), `404 POST_NOT_FOUND`."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Modifier un article",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"Mon premier article (relu)\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/manage/posts/{{postId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["manage", "posts", "{{postId}}"]
            },
            "description": "Modifie `title` et/ou `content`. Un article publié modifié par un `guest-author` repasse en brouillon.\n\nErreurs : `400 VALIDATION_ERROR`, `403 FORBIDDEN`, `404 POST_NOT_FOUND`, `409 POST_CONFLICT` (modifié entre-temps : recharger puis réessayer)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
